-- Chapter 5: Burmese invasions and the Treaty of Yandabo
Second invasion (1819): a Burmese army of about 30,000 won the battle of Phulpanisiga on 15 February 1819.
Third invasion (1821 to 1822): the Burmese defeated Chandrakanta in 1822 and took control of Assam.$t$ from public.content where slug = $t$burmese-invasions-yandabo$t$ on conflict do nothing;
